text-raise:0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;\">지원으로 창업원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;\">창업교육센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;\">에서 재학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;\">휴학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;\">들의 창업 활성화를</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;\">위하여 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;\">년도 학생창업자들에 대한 창업지원비를 지원하고자 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명